				<r3d:description language="eng">The VerbundFDB (German Network of Educational Research Data) provides research data and instruments for educational sciences. Furthermore, it offers information, advice and training on research data management issues. It ensures the quality and usability of research data by working according to the FAIR principles (Findable, Accessible, Interoperable, Reusable). The VerbundFDB coordinates 13 national institutions. The research data centers collaborating in the VerbundFDB are accredited by the RatSWD (German Data Forum).</r3d:description>
